+  <!-- USE IN AI ASSISTANTS -->
+  <section id="use-in-ai" class="section">
+    <div class="container prose">
+      <h2>Use this data in Claude or ChatGPT</h2>
+      <p>
+        The deduction rules on this site are also available as a free MCP server. An AI assistant can use it to
+        work out the overtime, tips and senior deductions for a filing status and income, estimate the tax
+        saved, and explain who qualifies, using the 2025 to 2028 rules rather than what it remembers from training.
+        There is no account or API key.
+      </p>
+      <p style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Claude.ai or ChatGPT.</strong> Add a custom connector and paste this URL:</p>
+      <pre style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8125rem;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;color:var(--ink);"><code>https://no-tax-on-overtime-mcp.lipmichal.workers.dev/mcp</code></pre>
+      <p style="margin-bottom:6px;"><strong>Claude Code.</strong></p>
+      <pre style="margin:0 0 16px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border-strong);border-radius:8px;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8125rem;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;color:var(--ink);"><code>claude mcp add --transport http no-tax-on-overtime https://no-tax-on-overtime-mcp.lipmichal.workers.dev/mcp</code></pre>
+      <p class="muted"><a href="https://github.com/theluckystrike/no-tax-on-overtime-mcp">Source, tools and other install options on GitHub</a></p>
+    </div>
